# The two answers to being read that a player can build (owner 2026-09-17,
# docs/VISION.md §9.3), on the real keys: a spoofer that hides the whole place
# while there is power in it, and a decoy walked out past the yard, which hides
# nothing and is read in the place's stead.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/defences.tour --seed=1 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 \
#     --holding=hut,wind_spinner,battery_stack,radio_mast \
#     --give=record:1,copper:4,scrap:8,timber:4,rag:4
#
# (--holding stands a loud place with power in it already: a mast and the
# spinner and cells that feed it. Building those is the settlements tour's proof;
# this one starts where a player reaches for an answer. The record in --give is
# the one taken off a carrier in tours/raids.tour — a spoofer is built round one.)
coast calm
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-loud-place-with-power-in-it with holding, piece:radio_mast, land:coast
# What a machine hears of it, before anything is done about it.
tap holding
await app:holding 4
wait 0.6
shot 02-what-a-machine-hears-before with app:holding
# The spoofer: the relay's voice box on a stake, wired to the cells.
choose build_spoofer
tap use
await made 8
await spoofing 6
wait 0.6
shot 03-what-it-hears-with-a-spoofer-running with app:holding, spoofing
tap pause
wait 0.5
# A step aside, so the frame is of the spoofer and not of the back of the player.
walk 0,1 1.0
wait 0.6
shot 04-a-spoofer-in-the-yard with holding, piece:spoofer, spoofing
# The decoy has to be out past the yard: in it, the slate says why not before
# anything is spent.
tap holding
await app:holding 4
choose build_decoy_mast
tap use
wait 0.4
shot 05-a-decoy-in-the-yard-is-the-yard with app:holding
tap pause
wait 0.5
# Out along the open ground, on the real keys, and put it up there. The holding
# key closes the page whether the slate took the piece or refused it, so a try
# that was not far enough out walks on with its hands free.
try 4
  walk 1,0 2.2
  tap holding
  await app:holding 4
  choose build_decoy_mast
  tap use
  wait 0.5
  tap holding
  await lure 3
end
walk -1,0 0.7
wait 1.0
shot 06-a-decoy-out-past-the-yard with lure, piece:decoy_mast
